      "content": "it's not just sadness. it's like the anchor is gone and i'm just drifting. i used to have a life, goals, a personality... but all of that was built around them. now i'm just existing in a world that doesn't make sense anymore. it feels so heavy. like why even bother trying to fix something that's fundamentally broken?",
