      "content": "self-care feels like a joke. how can i care for someone who doesn't even exist? it's like i'm trying to maintain a corpse. they were the life in me... everything that actually mattered. it just feels so wrong to be here, in this light, while they're just... gone. it doesn't feel right that i'm still here and they aren't.",
